# Integer division by zero is DS4003, pointing at the division even when a later operator
# follows (D-014).
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where 1 / (strlen(orderId) - 6) > 0
| project orderId
---- expected
error[DS4003]: integer division by zero
  --> query:2:9
  |
2 | | where 1 / (strlen(orderId) - 6) > 0
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the divisor is zero for at least one row
  |
  = help: convert to `real` to get `inf` or `NaN` instead, or filter out the zero divisors with `where`
